Description: Open-source photo editor
 Image editing; an open-source, clean-room reimplementation of Adobe Photoshop,
 rebuilt in pure Rust.
 .
 Layers, masks, adjustment layers, layer styles, type, vectors, brushes and
 real PSD files, in a native app written entirely in Rust.
 .
 Open source, offline, and yours.
